      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "そしてポケモン選択画面レイドバトルポケモン捕獲<br>\n<br>\nみんなに楽しんでもらいたくてたくさん音楽作って赤緑なフレーズもたっぷり入れました！{% lineblog_image id=\"line-9287844-004\" alt=\"_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_131APPLE_IMG_1378.JPG\" %}<br>\n<br>",
      "images": [
        "line-9287844-004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "いやー",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "久しぶりにたくさん曲を作って",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "久しぶりに締切に追い込まれるという(笑)<br>\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-9287844-005\" alt=\"_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_131APPLE_IMG_1373.JPG\" %}<br>",
      "images": [
        "line-9287844-005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "自分で曲数 増やしたんだけど・・・辛かったー(笑)<br>\n<br>",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "レイドバトル",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "まだやってない人",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "音楽を聞いたことない人は",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "ぜひ お友達とプレイしてみてね！",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "新たな発見があるかも！<br>\n<br>\nそしていま",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": null,
      "markdown": "サトシの帽子をかぶったピカチュウも登場しているので必ずゲットだぜ！",
      "images": []
